      children: "OpenClaw (346k+ GitHub stars, MIT license, created by Peter Steinberger) is the most-starred open-source project of 2026. It started as Clawdbot in late 2025 and became a phenomenon — a personal AI agent that lives in your messaging apps and executes tasks autonomously."
